  "markdown": "251\n\n\nGREAT SEAL OF THE STATE OF IDAHO [GREAT SEAL OF THE STATE OF IDAHO]\n\n\n# CERTIFICATE OF ORGANIZATION\n\n## LIMITED LIABILITY COMPANY\n\nTitle 30, Chapters 21 and 25, Idaho Code\nBase Filing fee: $100.00 typed, $120 not typed\nComplete and submit the application in **duplicate**.\n\n\n[STAMPED]\nFILED EFFECTIVE\n\n\n[STAMPED]\n2018 APR-9 PM 2:51\nSECRETARY OF STATE\nSTATE OF IDAHO\n\n\n1. The name of the limited liability company is:\nCAPITAL ASSET REALTY, LLC\n(Remember to include the words \"Limited Liability Company,\" \"Limited Company, \"or the abbreviations L.L.C., LLC, or LC)\n2. The complete street and mailing addresses of the principal office is:\n6734 N. MADELLAINE DRIVE, COEUR D'ALENE, ID. 83815\n(Street Address)\nP.O. BOX 790 COEUR D'ALENE, ID 83816\n(Mailing Address, if different)\n3. The name and complete street address of the registered agent:\nJohn W. Keighley, III 6734 N. Madellaine, Dr. Coeur d'Alene, ID 838915\n(Name) (Address)\n4. The name and address of at least one governor of the limited liability company:\nJohn W. Keighley, III 6734 N. Madellaine Dr. Coeur d'Alene, ID 83815\n(Name) (Address)\nJohn W. Keighley, Jr. 6734 N. Madellaine Dr. Coeur d'Alene, ID 83815\n(Name) (Address)\n(Name) (Address)\n(Name) (Address)\n5. Mailing address for future correspondence (annual report notices):\nP.O. Box 790 Coeur d'Alene, ID 83816\n(Address)\n\n\n[SIGNED]\nSignature of organizer(s).\nPrinted Name: John W. Keighley, III\nSignature: [SIGNATURE]\nPrinted Name: John W. Keighley, Jr.\nSignature:\n[SIGNATURE]\n[SIGNATURE]\nRev. 01/2018\n\n\n[STAMPED][SIGNED]\nSecretary of State use only\nIDAHO SECRETARY OF STATE\n04/09/2018 05:00\nCK:1759 CT:355915 BH:1637131\n1@ 100.00 = 100.00 ORGAN LLC #2\n1@ 20.00 = 20.00 EXPEDITE C #3\nW199421\n\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m42b7fnm3wymw3ega4tpad7y -->",
